Sokha has three missed calls from his boss. He calls back, but it's a busy line. The second time, a stranger answers: Sorry, wrong number! The third time, the receptionist says: Hold on, please. Then: He isn't here. Would you like to leave a message? Sokha puts the phone on speaker phone, writes down the details and hangs up.

